n; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_usage_log_pricing_qualified_2ca9.py tests/unit/test_usage_log_repetition_a89d.py tests/unit/test_usage_log_run_shape_aec1.py tests/unit/test_user_guide_dc_docs.py tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py tests/unit/test_verdict_provenance_wiring.py tests/unit/test_verdict_provenance.py tests/unit/test_verifier_class.py tests/unit/test_verify_empty_batch_contract.py tests/unit/test_verify_gate_parity.py tests/unit/test_verify_identity_a2c7_perf.py tests/unit/test_verify_opcert_ac_coverage.py tests/unit/test_verify_opcert_heldout.py tests/unit/test_verify_opcert.py tests/unit/test_wall_clock_assert_lint.py tests/unit/test_web_tool_gating.py tests/unit/test_wip_hold_guidance.py tests/unit/test_workflow_names.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_usage_log_pricing_qualified_2ca9.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_usage_log_repetition_a89d.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_usage_log_run_shape_aec1.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_user_guide_dc_docs.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the sco